  "reason": "The existing evidence is entirely absent, so the first experiment should test a multimodal baseline to evaluate if combining RNA and image data improves performance. This clarifies the potential value of multimodal approaches, which are central to the study. Testing a simple concatenation fusion with standard encoders (PCA for RNA, ResNet50 for images) isolates the effect of modality combination without overcomplicating other factors."
